00:03:05.520 --> 00:03:07.080
I may not like where this is positioned.

88
00:03:07.080 --> 00:03:09.560
I'm just gonna kind of leave it right here for now.

89
00:03:09.560 --> 00:03:10.879
And that's it for that,

90
00:03:10.879 --> 00:03:13.199
